  "title": "Exotic Earthy Malaysian Pork Curry",
  "description": "A jammy and springy Malaysian dish featuring ground pork, served in a copper mug, perfect for a monsoon evening. This vegetarian-friendly curry is made with brine-wet ingredients.",
